      (GlobalTheory.IndefiniteRowSideFullHecke.UnitCharTriangle.stdSnd ν e I a A' WW βA βW) :=
  fun ν hν e S he I hI a A WW ΛA ΛW hA hW βA βW => GlobalTheory.StdSndSB.main ν hν e S he I hI a A WW ΛA ΛW hA hW βA βW
